OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA dry
OL,6,Fstart to the weekend, with sunny
OL,7,Fspells the odd shower by Sunday.
OL,8,FTurning warm on Saturday, but
OL,9,Ftemperatures will slowly decrease into
OL,10,Fnext week.
